You now need to access the pier to reach the Zubr Boat extraction. You can reach the door to the pier in a few ways:
* You can go through the container loading bay in the east, this avoids fighting the [[Bosses|Scav Boss]] that can spawn, but requires backtracking, and is a longer path. (Green path)
* You can go through the container loading bay in the center, but you might have to fight the [[Bosses|Scav Boss]] that can spawn, in addition to the team of [[Black Division]] operatives nearby. (Blue path)
* You can go through the container loading bay in the west, sticking close to the water, this may avoid fighting the [[Bosses|Scav Boss]] that can spawn, but can end up in a long distance battle with a squad of [[Black Division]] operatives at the end of the loading bay. (Purple path)

'''On all possible paths, you will have to fight squads of [[Black Division]] operatives before reaching the pier door.'''
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:TheTicketTerminalReachingPierPathMap.png|Possible paths to Pier door.
</gallery></li>

===Escape from Tarkov===
Once the '''Pier door''' has been opened, all players in the raid will have 3 minutes to reach the '''Zubr Boat''' extraction at the end of the pier before the extraction becomes unavailable regardless of the current raid time left. '''You will have to fight a final team of [[Black Division]] operatives on the pier, before reaching the boat.''' The extraction timer coincides with the three minute timer, once the timer is up, any players in the extraction zone will escape and a cinematic related to the ending you chose will start. 
<li style="display: inline-block;"><gallery widths="300" heights="169" mode="packed">
File:Zubr Boat.png|The extraction
</gallery></li>
Successfully completing the raid will allow you to obtain one of the game's endings. Upon dying or extracting, the state of your character is returned to what it was before entering [[Terminal]], besides the consumed [[The Ticket#Arrive_at_the_entrance_pathway_to_the_port_Terminal_4|access item]].

